{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>After getting taken in by a longtime friend of your family, Judy, you\u2019ve become her last hope to save both her and her struggling farm. Travel to Loho Valley and launch your own dating app startup. But beware, in Loho the competition is ruthless. Everyone is hustling for success, and if you slip up, you might end up as someone else\u2019s stepping stone.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3465660/extras/220dc0aa3eebc23eab03a12d8c5490a5.poster.avif?t=1772013110\" width=610 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3465660/extras/220dc0aa3eebc23eab03a12d8c5490a5.webm?t=1772013110\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3465660/extras/220dc0aa3eebc23eab03a12d8c5490a5.mp4?t=1772013110\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Loho is not only about business opportunities. It is full of gorgeous women looking to unwind, make connections, or just have a little fun. Baddies, Inc. is a choice-driven adult visual novel, featuring: </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >9000+ high-resolution renders</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >230+ high-quality animations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >20+ hours of gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A unique and immersive story where your choices carve your path and its destination</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Choices That Matter</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3465660/extras/e5c8cdadf63c284eb30487cd25d26fc0.poster.avif?t=1772013110\" width=656 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3465660/extras/e5c8cdadf63c284eb30487cd25d26fc0.webm?t=1772013110\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3465660/extras/e5c8cdadf63c284eb30487cd25d26fc0.mp4?t=1772013110\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're playing it safe and outdoing your competition by creating a top-notch app or just blowing up their server room, you're the one responsible for your actions; your path is a reflection of your choices. The same goes for your love life. You will have plenty of admirers, but you will need to stay focused on why you came to Loho in the first place. Your choices will shape both your path and your destination!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>High-Quality Animations</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3465660/extras/e35f9303a6ebba38507c94474c9f2b1f.poster.avif?t=1772013110\" width=650 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3465660/extras/e35f9303a6ebba38507c94474c9f2b1f.webm?t=1772013110\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3465660/extras/e35f9303a6ebba38507c94474c9f2b1f.mp4?t=1772013110\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into interactive, high-quality scenes that put you right in the action.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Switch between POVs, experiment with positions, and enjoy every encounter as its own unique experience. And once unlocked, everything will be available in the <i>gallery</i> for you to view and review <i>whenever you want, as many times as you need</i>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Lots of Baddies to Meet!</strong></h2><p class=\